    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d790-a10">

                <pb facs="0781" n="615" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg615"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 9—Exhibit H—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Council of the Danish West Indian National
                                Bank</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1910-08-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 13, 1910</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Having received a communication of the Minister of Finance under date of the 6th
                    instant, the bank council will state that it agrees to the conditions embodied
                    in the communication for the furnishing of a loan of 500,000 francs to the
                    harbor treasury of St. Thomas, including the wording of the text of the partial
                    bonds and their coupons.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">P. M. Damm</hi>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nordien</hi>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">To the Ministry of Finance.</hi>
                    </p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
